Toolkit assets (libs/toolkit/assets)
------------------------------------

Fonts, unmodified upstream static faces embedded by the toolkit, each with its
licence beside it in libs/toolkit/assets/fonts: Inter 4.1 Light, Regular,
Medium and SemiBold (The Inter Project Authors, SIL OFL 1.1) and JetBrains Mono
2.304 Regular (The JetBrains Mono Project Authors, SIL OFL 1.1).

Icons, unmodified SVGs from Lucide 1.54.0 (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide),
Lucide Icons and Contributors, ISC; the Feather-derived icons among them are
also Cole Bemis (Feather), MIT. Licence in libs/toolkit/assets/icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt.

Site assets (docs/web)
----------------------

The mixos.dev web fonts are subsets cut by docs/build/gen-site.mix from the
pinned asset set; each keeps its upstream licence beside it in docs/web/fonts:
Inter, JetBrains Mono and Quicksand (SIL OFL 1.1), Noto Color Emoji
(SIL OFL 1.1) and Material Symbols (Google LLC, Apache-2.0).
